&lt;p&gt;This project is powered by &lt;strong&gt;Gemma&lt;/strong&gt;, an open AI model, through Hugging Face.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Using an open model gave me more flexibility in how AI is integrated into the application and avoids tying the project entirely to a single proprietary AI provider.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The open approach also makes it easier to experiment with different models and gives the project a path toward self-hosted inference in the future.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For a student-built project, this is especially useful because it lowers the barrier to experimenting with modern AI while keeping the architecture flexible.&lt;/p&gt;

